% Fallback for TeX installs without the helvetic package: the ICLR style loads phvb (Helvetica-Bold)
% only for the reviewer line-number ruler. When phvb.tfm is absent, kpathsea resolves it to ptmb (Times Bold);
% main.tex adds the matching pdfTeX map line. Ignored when the real phvb.tfm exists.
ptmb phvb
